Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Delivering the Energy Seed is exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to mail a package? Come this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.26,0:00:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Ant Express!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.50,0:00:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what is delivered or where it’s delivered,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.38,0:00:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we will deliver it for you swiftly and safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.54,0:00:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Need a delivery? Contact us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,“All missions, all finished” is our motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you guys falling for these scammy ads?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.18,0:00:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Who’s there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a delivery.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My ice cream didn’t even melt en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.34,0:01:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My wooden tower didn’t even fall en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.10,0:01:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re so stable!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My spider web hair clip is still intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.86,0:01:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ant Express is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.78,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can just have the Energy Seed delivered to the Big Tree’s Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, how can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I need something delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.14,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m worried that you won’t be able to get there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.18,0:01:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Never fear! We at Ant Express can deliver parcels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to any place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.90,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please deliver this to the Big Tree’s Summit for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.94,0:02:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, we can’t deliver parcels to the Big Tree’s Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.30,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t your ads say that you can deliver to anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That place is very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s against Ant Express regulations to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. Ant Express is a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Need to make a delivery?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.86,0:02:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really willing to deliver it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told that you can’t go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.62,0:02:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I’ve never heard of a place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,where we ants can’t go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me. I’ll get it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? This is a very important parcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Here at Ant Express, “all missions, all finished”.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.66,0:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m Andy. This is my work ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.34,0:03:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I’ll leave it to you, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.34,0:03:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m Paddi. Tell me once it’s been delivered, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.54,0:03:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s so professional. I don’t need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my boss gets to see my skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.66,0:03:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll become a permanent Ant Express courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll climb the ranks to general manager
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and reach the pinnacle of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can stop for a snack first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,—Andy?　—Paddi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you delivering my parcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well… Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.50,0:04:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to eat before working, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.94,0:04:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.86,0:04:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.26,0:04:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be on my way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so full.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll take a nap first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.14,0:04:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.34,0:04:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren’t you delivering my parcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were you sleeping here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.14,0:04:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:04:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to sleep to regain energy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t disturb you, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.38,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me know when it’s done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s my parcel?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.26,0:05:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really deliver the Energy Seed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.14,0:05:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to the Big Tree’s Summit already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.62,0:05:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You people at Ant Express are truly something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t delivered it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why haven’t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Where’s the Energy Seed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:05:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren’t you a master courier?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.94,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you lose it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I’m just an intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.58,0:06:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t delivered a single parcel yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that no one was delivering your parcel,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so I decided to give it a go,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.42,0:06:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find the Energy Seed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.10,0:06:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I’m never trusting you again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to tell you that there’s a chasm up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.78,0:06:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve found signs of the Energy Seed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Paddi,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll make sure to get it back for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I’m not trusting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.54,0:07:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Paddi go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on with Sirius?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dumped this litter here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The Energy Seed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.38,0:08:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! That was too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.78,0:08:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.46,0:08:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let Wolffy take the Energy Seed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.70,0:08:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll ask for it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head down. I’ll think of something myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I really unable to open it without the goats’ handprints?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.34,0:08:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.10,0:09:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,that I can’t open you without handprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.30,0:09:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh. I’m trying to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is this box made of?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If only Weslie were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.22,0:09:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll help you get it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.30,0:09:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don’t go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Give back my parcel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Finders keepers, losers weepers! Hands off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I’m never losing a parcel ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands off. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, Andy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve come as well, Paddi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We can talk about this, Mr. Ant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.74,0:10:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I use this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.46,0:10:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s this button for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.38,0:10:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.10,0:10:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn’t you let go of the box back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I’ve always dreamed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,of becoming a dedicated Ant Express courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.26,0:10:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of Ant Express,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t lose a parcel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.26,0:10:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I stopped trusting you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d have loved to deliver your parcel to the Big Tree’s Summit,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but I almost lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.30,0:11:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m a failed courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But didn’t you get it back to me again, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.34,0:11:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you’re already an outstanding courier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Paddi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.74,0:11:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever been so kind to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we’re quite similar, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope we can meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have branches all throughout the Big Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure we’ll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s time to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.78,0:12:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.42,0:12:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Until next time, Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.10,0:12:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Auntie Ant calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.66,0:12:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Auntie Ant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.38,0:12:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Andy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.54,0:12:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,congratulations on becoming a permanent Ant Express courier!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, you may deliver parcels.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
